/*
 * Implements semantic validation for class fields.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of local field declarations,
 *   - type checking and value inference for field initializers,
 *   - enforcement of class-level restrictions on field types,
 *   - detection of field shadowing within the class,
 *   - detection of field collisions with ancestor fields,
 *   - detection of field–method name collisions,
 *   - construction of VarDeclValue entries for class layout,
 *   - integration with ClassFieldVerification for structural checks.
 *
 * Field validation occurs before layout validation and before method/ctor
 * finalization. It ensures that all fields of a class are well-typed,
 * non-conflicting, and legal with respect to the class’s representation
 * (entity, struct, overlaid, etc.).
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::fields
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/fields.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-26
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
